  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Electrophile will attack at ortho and Para position with respect to better Electron releasing group(ERG)</p><p>ERG : &ndash; OH &gt; &ndash; CH<sub>3</sub></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0101_a4ab1aa1f133.png\" style=\"width: 160px; height: 134px;\" /></p><p>Para position with respect to group <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>OH</mi></math>&nbsp;group&nbsp;and it will be meta position with respect to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> group.</p>"
